__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
data/scorecard.json.pre-apply
sweep-report.md

# scorecard backups (git history is the real backup)
data/.backups/

# The Husband Course heavy media (audio, video, slide PDFs, infographics).
# ~2 GB of Notebook by Gemini artifacts. These live ONLY in the R2 bucket
# (usmcmin-com-site), uploaded out-of-band with tmc-husband/sync-media.sh —
# never through git. The deploy workflow excludes the same paths from its
# `rclone sync` so a deploy can never delete them. Light artifacts (reports,
# quiz + flashcard source exports) stay tracked here.
assets/media/tmc-husband/*/audio/
assets/media/tmc-husband/*/video/
assets/media/tmc-husband/*/slides/
assets/media/tmc-husband/*/infographics/
